eight:0.1828em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"optimizer = optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3, weight_decay=0.01)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight_decay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>AdamW 是当前 Transformer 训练的标准优化器。它确保了每个参数的权重衰减强度一致，不受自适应学习率的干扰。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Adam + L2</th>\n<th>AdamW</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>权重衰减方式</td>\n<td>加入梯度</td>\n<td>独立步骤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与自适应 LR 的关系</td>\n<td>耦合</td>\n<td>解耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效衰减强度</td>\n<td>因参数而异</td>\n<td>全局一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练效果</td>\n<td>较好</td>\n<td>更好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习率调度策略\">学习率调度策略</h2><p>学习率是训练中最重要的超参数。固定学习率很难兼顾训练初期的快速收敛和后期的精细调优。学习率调度器在训练过程中动态调整学习率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torch.optim.lr_scheduler import CosineAnnealingLR, OneCycleLR&#10;&#10;scheduler = CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=100, eta_min=1e-6)&#10;&#10;scheduler = OneCycleLR(optimizer, max_lr=1e-3, total_steps=10000, pct_start=0.1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.optim.lr_scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CosineAnnealingLR, OneCycleLR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">T_max</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">eta_min</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scheduler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OneCycleLR(optimizer, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e-3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">total_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pct_start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Warmup</strong> 在训练初期从极小的学习率线性增长到目标值，避免初始阶段因随机权重导致的大梯度更新破坏训练。Warmup 对 Transformer 训练尤为关键。</p>\n<p><strong>余弦退火</strong>将学习率按余弦函数从初始值平滑衰减到接近零，在训练后期提供精细的参数调整。</p>\n<p><strong>OneCycleLR</strong> 将训练分为上升和下降两个阶段，学习率先增大后减小，同时动量反向变化。这种策略通常能在更少的 epoch 内达到更好的效果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>初期行为</th>\n<th>中期行为</th>\n<th>后期行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Step Decay</td>\n<td>恒定</td>\n<td>阶梯下降</td>\n<td>很小</td>\n<td>传统 CNN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余弦退火</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>平滑下降</td>\n<td>接近零</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Warmup + 余弦</td>\n<td>线性上升</td>\n<td>平滑下降</td>\n<td>接近零</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OneCycleLR</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>快速下降</td>\n<td>快速训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((优化算法))&#10;    基础方法&#10;      SGD&#10;      动量法&#10;      Nesterov&#10;    自适应方法&#10;      AdaGrad&#10;      RMSProp&#10;      Adam&#10;    工程改进&#10;      AdamW 解耦衰减&#10;      LAMB 大 batch&#10;      梯度裁剪&#10;    学习率调度&#10;      Warmup&#10;      余弦退火&#10;      OneCycleLR\">mindmap\n  root((优化算法))\n    基础方法\n      SGD\n      动量法\n      Nesterov\n    自适应方法\n      AdaGrad\n      RMSProp\n      Adam\n    工程改进\n      AdamW 解耦衰减\n      LAMB 大 batch\n      梯度裁剪\n    学习率调度\n      Warmup\n      余弦退火\n      OneCycleLR</pre><ul>\n<li>SGD + Momentum 是 CNN 训练的经典选择，噪声有助于泛化</li>\n<li>Adam 结合动量和自适应学习率，是通用的默认优化器</li>\n<li>AdamW 通过解耦权重衰减修复了 Adam 的正则化问题，是 Transformer 的标配</li>\n<li>学习率调度策略（Warmup + 余弦退火）对大模型训练至关重要</li>\n<li>LAMB/LARS 通过按层缩放学习率支持超大 batch size 训练</li>\n<li>优化器选择需要结合模型架构、数据规模和训练预算综合决策</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"优化算法","id":"优化算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SGD 与动量法","id":"sgd-与动量法"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应学习率优化器","id":"自适应学习率优化器"},{"level":2,"text":"AdamW 与权重衰减","id":"adamw-与权重衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"学习率调度策略","id":"学习率调度策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图神经网络应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/graph-neural-networks/graph-applications"},"next":{"title":"正则化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/training-at-scale/regularization-techniques"}}